Funding Source. - The funds required for the
implementation of this Act, including employee benefits, shall be
(a) Collections from NBI clearance and certification fees;
(b) Incidental income from trainings, tests, and the like;
(c) Proceeds from the sale of confiscated/forfeited articles
after public auction from the cases investigated by the NBI upon
order of the court;
(d) Other fees which may be determined and imposed by
the Director; and
(e) The General Appropriations Act.
